sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (browser or mobile)
    participant API as kpmpl-api
    participant RL as in-process rate limiter (ADR-036)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login {username, password}
    API->>RL: 5/min per IP+username (per-replica), progressive account delay, lockout
    API->>API: argon2id verify (dummy hash for unknown user, identical 401)
    API->>DB: BEGIN (per-user advisory lock 6200001,hashtext(userId)): count live sessions
    alt over SESSION_MAX_PER_USER (default 5)
        API->>DB: revoke THIS user's oldest sessions + audit session_evicted (fix F-07)
    end
    API->>DB: INSERT Session (refresh_token_hash, csrf_token_hash, 12h) + audit COMMIT
    API-->>U: web: __Host-kpmpl_sid cookie / mobile: refresh + ES256 access (15 min)

    U->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (mobile)
    API->>DB: verify hash, check idle 2h + absolute 12h
    alt presented secret matches history (reuse)
        API->>DB: revoke session + audit refresh_reuse_revoked (fix F-06 restores this)
        API-->>U: 401
    else valid
        API->>DB: BEGIN: new refresh hash + RefreshTokenHistory insert COMMIT
        API-->>U: new tokens
    end

    U->>API: any write (cookie)
    API->>API: CSRF proof: Origin allowlist + X-Requested-With: kpmpl-web
    API->>DB: in-tx re-verification: session live + user active (else 401)

    U->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/change-password
    API->>DB: BEGIN: passwordHash update + mustChangePassword=false + revoke other sessions + audit COMMIT

    Note over U,DB: first-login (mustChangePassword=true): only /auth/me, /auth/logout, /auth/change-password served
